1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
Next, we will talk about how to do the round-shaped processing of the front part of the round shape.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:14,000
We all know that there are more A, B, C, D, E, F in the round shape,

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,000
so it will be more complicated when we actually make it.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Our A-shape and X-shape are all sawn.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:26,000
In order to make our production more simple, we can combine all A-shape and B-shape.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,000
In 3D, the round-shaped processing is relatively simple.

7
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,000
We use the editor's dot-and-line tool,

8
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:36,000
press the Shift key to select the two edges of the A-shape,

9
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
press the right mouse button, and select Cut.

10
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,000
At this point, we will cut this shape and delete it.

11
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,000
After deleting it, press the Shift key to select the original shape edge of the A-shape,

12
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,000
press the Shift key to select the original shape edge of the A-shape,

13
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,000
and press a button to merge it.

14
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:01,000
In this way, we can see that the volume of the round shape will increase,

15
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,000
and the volume will merge with the A-shape.

16
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Similarly, let us do the same for the B-shape.

17
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Press the Shift key to select the two edges of the A-shape,

18
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:12,000
press the right mouse button, release the Shift key to select the A-shape,

19
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,000
press the right mouse button, and then select Cut.

20
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:19,000
After you cut, you can delete this part in the middle,

21
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,000
and after deleting it, change to the edit and line tool,

22
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:25,000
press the Shift key and then the left mouse button,

23
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,000
and connect the two edges of the B-thread with the right-click key.

24
00:01:29,799 --> 00:01:32,400
After we've done this,

25
00:01:33,599 --> 00:01:38,000
because the board is not symmetrical,

26
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:40,000
we need to do it again.

27
00:01:42,799 --> 00:01:48,799
Now we've completed the process of removing the A-thread and moving it to the C-thread.

28
00:01:48,799 --> 00:01:52,200
We only need to keep the C-thread.

